        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Randy Savage, Lanny Poffo, Tatsutoshi Goto\n- Organizations: World Wrestling Federation (WWF/WWE), World Championship Wrestling (WCW), nWo Japan\n- Places: Atlanta, Georgia\n- Roles: professional wrestler, color commentator\n\nFacts:\n- Randy Savage, born Randy Mario Poffo, was an American professional wrestler and color commentator who lived from November 15, 1952 to May 20, 2011.\n- Randy Savage was better known by the ring name \"Macho Man\" Randy Savage.\n- Randy Savage was best known for his time in the World Wrestling Federation, now called WWE, and later in World Championship Wrestling.\n- World Championship Wrestling, Inc. was an American professional wrestling promotion based in Atlanta, Georgia.\n- Lanny Poffo was the real-life younger brother of Randy Savage.\n- Tatsutoshi Goto briefly competed in World Championship Wrestling as part of nWo Japan.",
